    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74426" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄπεᾰς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰτος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>awl,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.141
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄπεαρ</span>
			) ; dat. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέατι</span> in
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.70
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὔπεα</span>
			, and 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάπτει ὑπητίῳ</span>”
				<i>rupiat,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gloss.
				</span></i>
			 :— 
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπήτιον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Nicoch.
				9
			</span></i> (dub., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄπεαρ</span> Kock), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				21.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>De.</u>
				15.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Peripl.M.Rubr.</u>
				17
			</span></i> ; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπητίδιον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.83
			</span></i>. (Prob. from same root as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπή.</span>)</div>
